msgid "Clear stored API key"
msgstr "Slett lagra API-nøkkel"

#: admin.py:168
msgid ""
"A key is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new key to "
"replace it. The stored value cannot be viewed."
msgstr ""
"Ein nøkkel er lagra kryptert. Lat felta stå tomme for å behalde han, eller "
"skriv inn ein ny nøkkel for å erstatte han. Den lagra verdien kan ikkje visast."

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"Vert lagt inn ein gong, lagra kryptert, og kan ikkje visast igjen. Lat felta "
"stå tomme for å bruke OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."

#: admin.py:216
msgid "API key status"
msgstr "Status for API-nøkkel"

#: admin.py:219
msgid "Stored (encrypted, not visible)"
msgstr "Lagra (kryptert, ikkje synleg)"

#: admin.py:220
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Ikkje angitt"

